    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get Wrecked!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553810/extras/cf62467d3fd65f87951634bf0395b21a.avif?t=1746382825\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get ready for Wrecked, where racing and chaos collide. Perform outrageous stunts, smash cars, and embrace total destruction. With insane driving and demolition, every race is a thrilling ride into mayhem!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553810/extras/ab8f1788cc33e9e567940e63b6f4160d.poster.avif?t=1746382825\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553810/extras/ab8f1788cc33e9e567940e63b6f4160d.webm?t=1746382825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553810/extras/ab8f1788cc33e9e567940e63b6f4160d.mp4?t=1746382825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Wrecked!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your super smashing power to demolish everything in your path and master the art of unfair stunts with your insane driving skills, navigating through chaotic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553810/extras/ae987040dd8df4c082e1d58eba152131.poster.avif?t=1746382825\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553810/extras/ae987040dd8df4c082e1d58eba152131.webm?t=1746382825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553810/extras/ae987040dd8df4c082e1d58eba152131.mp4?t=1746382825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 40 exhilarating levels, you\u2019ll race through a variety of wild environments like ramps, bridges, and even running trains. Experience the thrill of jaw-dropping front and back flips!</p>",
